<title>SPAIN: Seat says not affected by Lopez charges.</title>
<headline>Seat says not affected by Lopez charges.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German carmaker Volkswagen AG's Spanish car unit Sociedad Espanola de Automoviles de Turismo SA (Seat) said on Thursday it did not see itself affected by the charges presented against a former top Volkswagen executive, Jose Ignacio Lopez de Arriortua.</p>
<p>&quot;This matter doesn't affect Seat at all,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters when asked about the implications of this case for Seat, where Lopez is a member of the supervisory board.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
